ut it's also very concerning for the  dhs law enforcement officers who are on  the front lines  who are now having to deal with  thousands of individuals that have no  medical history have very little  identification you don't know where they  came from and they're having to deal  with these folks in a coveted  environment  and so we're putting their lives at risk  as well and i just uh  again my heart breaks for him and and  everybody's heart is breaking  for them because now they're you know  in these facilities which the binding  administration claims is not the same  situation  that was the case for the trump  administration and during the trump  administration we had all these  headlines that  trump was putting kids in cages i mean  it's absolutely  incredibly you know hypocritical to hear  jen pasaki now the spokesperson for  president biden defend this here she was  this week talking about one of the  biggest stories of the week listen to  this  i just want to ask you about cpac i know  you got some questions about this  yesterday if i could try again  based on our reporting former president  trump is  going to be talking about president  biden's immigration policies he will  point to the uptick in migrants  coming to the u.s how is the  administration planning to respond  well we're not looking to former  president trump or any of his advisors  as a model for how we're approaching  immigration  in fact we're in the circumstance we're  in because uh not only was their  approach  inhumane it was ineffective and so we're  going to forge our own path forward  we'll see what he says but our focus is  certainly not what on president trump is  saying at cpac  your reaction to that chad she says our  own approach but isn't that approach the  same exact buildings  uh where they were kids in cages under  trump but now they're migrant facilities  according to the washington post  well absolutely those comments by jen  pasake are not only absurd they're just  dishonest 