iduals making  up families come into the country  almost 90 of them are still here they  are still here  uh either in the shadows or going  through proceedings so what we know and  what the facts tell us is  they don't leave even they even though  they have no legal right to be here and  so i think at the end of the day  one has to assume that's what the biden  administration wants  all right we will leave it there chad  good to see you this morning thanks very  much we'll keep spotlighting these  important issues  for the american people chad wolfe

